# ============================================================
# VERTICAL RAINCLOUD PLOT — LIN / NER — ONE GRAPH PER BINDING SITE
#
# X = Compound
# Y = Binding affinity (kcal/mol)
#
# Plot organization for each compound:
#   LEFT   = individual-observation band + overlaid boxplot
#   RIGHT  = half-density cloud
#
# Y-axis rules used in this version:
#   Benzodiazepine site:   0 to -10
#   Barbiturate site:      0 to -8  (major tick every 2)
#   GABA orthosteric site: 55 to -10
#
# More negative values appear visually higher.
#
# Required columns:
#   site | compound | affinity
# Compounds: DZP | PHB | GABA | LIN | NER
#
# Also accepts:
#   binding_site instead of site
#
# Output:
#   One transparent PNG for each binding site.
# ============================================================


